 **Data Structures:**
-- `points_2D`: Tensor of shape $(W \cdot H, 2)$, containing the coordinates of every pixel center.
-- `power`: Tensor of shape $(N, W \cdot H)$, containing the negative half-squared Mahalanobis distance for each Gaussian-pixel pair.
-- `exp_power`: Tensor of shape $(N, W \cdot H)$, containing the exponential of the power term.
